* SPICE Netlist for the given circuit

* Voltage Source
V_X 2 3 DC <voltage_value>

* Current Source
I_X 3 5 DC <current_value>

* Resistor
R1 5 4 <resistance_value>

* Diode
D1 4 2 D_model

* Voltage Battery
V_B 4 0 DC <battery_voltage>

.model D_model D(IS=<saturation_current>, N=<emission_coefficient>)

.END